ment.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a cinematic, realistic style with soft, natural lighting and a shallow depth of field.\n[Shot 1] The shot is a continuous, single-take close-up filmed from a low angle, looking slightly up at <Subject 1>. The composition centers on her face and upper chest, with the background softly blurred to show the large window and hanging Edison bulbs of <Subject 2>. At the start, <Subject 1> holds a white ceramic coffee cup with both hands, her head tilted slightly forward, and her expression is clearly bored and listless, with half-lidded eyes and a flat mouth. Around 00:02.000, she slowly lifts her gaze toward the window on the left. Her eyes widen slightly, and a soft, genuine smile spreads across her face as her expression brightens into visible happiness. By 00:04.000, the smile fades; her eyebrows draw together, her mouth drops into a slight frown, and her eyes lose their brightness, her face settling into a clear look of disappointment as the video ends.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet indoor café room tone with a faint, low hum of a distant street and a soft, muffled clink of ceramic.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 447, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [277.7547302246094, 453.0927429199219], "pos": [324.4856262207031, 5554.57470703125], "id": 239, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 24}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ff1414", "widgets_values": ["# 如果是文戏，总步数设置为6步，transition_step设置为5步即可.如果是激烈打戏，总步数设置为8步，transition_step设置为6步即可.\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#ff0000", "size": [568.1500244140625, 136.9884796142578], "pos": [42.60768508911133, 4681.79296875], "id": 237, "properties